+# Activities
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/activities`
+
+Returns a paginated list of account activity the current user can access, newest first.
+
+__Parameters:__
+
+| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
+|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
+| `creator_ids[]` | array | No | Only include activity from these users |
+| `board_ids[]` | array | No | Only include activity on these boards |
+
+__Response:__
+
+```json
+[
+  {
+    "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohde",
+    "action": "card_assigned",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+    "description": "David assigned JZ to &quot;The logo isn&#39;t big enough&quot;",
+    "particulars": {
+      "assignee_ids": [
+        "03f5v9zk1dtqduod5bkhv3k8m"
+      ]
+    },
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/1",
+    "eventable_type": "Card",
+    "eventable": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohdb",
+      "number": 1,
+      "title": "The logo isn't big enough",
+      "status": "published"
+    },
+    "board": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcy",
+      "name": "Fizzy",
+      "all_access": true,
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcy"
+    },
+    "creator": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+      "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+      "role": "owner",
+      "active": true,
+      "email_address": "david@example.com",
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+    }
+  }
+]
+```
+
+The `particulars` object contains event-specific details:
+
+| Action | Particulars |
+|--------|-------------|
+| `card_assigned`, `card_unassigned` | `assignee_ids` |
+| `card_board_changed` | `old_board`, `new_board` |
+| `card_title_changed` | `old_title`, `new_title` |
+| `card_triaged` | `column` |
+
+Other events return an empty `particulars` object. Missing board, title, or column values are returned as empty strings.
+
+For card events, `url` opens the card. For comment events, `url` opens the card where the comment was posted and jumps to that comment.
